    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #320\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPush succeeded. Branch `bb/relay-228-agent-runtime-01-08-persist-agent-life-thr_7g8jw5h4py` is up to date on origin.\n\n## Summary\n\nFixed the CI failure on PR #320: the `check-migration-numbering` check failed because `develop` had gained two new migrations (`0013_relation_cardinality.sql`, `0014_relation_config_repair.sql`) that collided with this branch's `0013_agent_run_events.sql`.\n\n- Rebased the branch cleanly onto the latest `develop`.\n- Renamed the new migration to `0015_agent_run_events.sql`, the next free ordinal.\n- Re-verified: build clean, `check:boundaries` clean, `check-migration-numbering` clean (15 unique ordinals), unit tests 83/83, integration tests 423/423 (confirmed stable across repeated runs), e2e tests 5/5.\n- Force-pushed over a stale automated merge commit that GitHub's bot had added to the remote branch in the meantime — verified it carried no unique content beyond the same `develop` commits already folded in by my rebase, so nothing was lost.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
