    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #320\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed successfully to branch `bb/relay-228-agent-runtime-01-08-persist-agent-life-thr_7g8jw5h4py`.\n\n## Summary\n\nAddressed the code-review findings on PR #320:\n\n- Added a direct test for `listAgentRunEvents` (`packages/data/src/__tests__/agentRunEventsStore.test.ts`), verifying ordering, field mapping, and per-run scoping — previously it was only exercised indirectly via raw SQL in the lifecycle-adapter tests.\n- Fixed the low-severity `Number(r.id)` precision-loss suggestion in `lifecycleAdapter.test.ts` by comparing bigserial ids as `BigInt`.\n- Hardened `lifecycleAdapter.ts`'s error path so a secondary failure in the `finishAgentRun` error-path UPDATE can no longer swallow the original session error.\n- Kept `systemPromptOverride` in the adapter's contract, since issue #228's Task explicitly requires wrapping \"the `systemPromptOverride` hook from `pi-agent-core`,\" and the review's own acceptance-criteria table scores that as a met requirement — removing it would have contradicted the issue and regressed those criteria. Documented this reasoning in the commit message for the reviewer.\n\n**Verification:** build clean, `check:boundaries` clean, migration-numbering check clean (15 unique ordinals), full test suite green in a single run — unit 83/83, integration 425/425 (36 files), e2e 5/5.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
